      "denominator_restriction_REJECTED": {
        "rejected_on": "2026-08-07",
        "why": "the proof SUBSETTED a full evaluation instead of running a restricted one, and restriction is not inert. build_intervention_context derives the deranged-image map and the neutral means from the row set it is given: dropping the 2,290 out-of-vocabulary rows takes the image set from 777 to 768, and 767 of the 768 shared images then map to a DIFFERENT partner. A genuine restricted evaluation would therefore change the shuffled-image condition outright and shift both fixed-input conditions. Exact equivalence was assumed by the construction of the proof, not established.",
